WEBVTT

00:03:58.317 --> 00:04:01.988
I just didn't know what I didn't know.

00:04:03.197 --> 00:04:07.368
There is no way a well-educated
white male can understand

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:10.037
how much the culture
is tilted in his favor.

00:04:10.788 --> 00:04:14.917
There's no way he can understand it
because it's all he's ever known.

00:04:15.418 --> 00:04:17.003
And all he ever will know.

00:04:18.087 --> 00:04:19.714
And conversely,

00:04:19.714 --> 00:04:23.509
there's no way that a woman can understand
the full import of that,

00:04:23.551 --> 00:04:26.470
because being a female
is all she's ever known.

00:04:26.971 --> 00:04:28.180
She might have an inkling

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:31.017
that she's working twice as hard
for half as much,